{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/807818-what-would-you-do-with-the-1-5-billion-powerball-winnings","id":807818,"title":"What would you do with the $1.5 billion Powerball winnings?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-13T06:18:06-08:00","id":807818,"title":"What would you do with the $1.5 billion Powerball winnings?","content":"If you were to win, the lump sum is estimated at $930 million, I think. What would you do with that money? Something I'm always curious about is what people would do in that situation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10575-lilappleblossom","name":"lilappleblossom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T06:43:10-08:00","id":807830,"title":"","content":"Pay for tuition and generally hope that I will never have to fell fear in regards to finance again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T06:45:01-08:00","id":807833,"title":"","content":"I hear that about tuition. Got about $80k in my fiance's student loans to pay off, that would be the first thing I do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10575-lilappleblossom","name":"lilappleblossom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T08:12:53-08:00","id":807894,"title":"","content":"1. Pay off my student loans and cars.<br /> 2. Help out some family members.<br /> 3. Invest the money wisely, so my fiance and I never have to work again. <br /> 4. Quit Job after current project is finished<br /> 5. Buy house somewhere with a great view of Mountains and a decent university<br /> 6. Spend my days writing short stories/novel, going to whatever university class catches my eye, and traveling","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T08:18:33-08:00","id":807901,"title":"","content":"Pay off mortgage, get son into good school, start him with an In-State Tuition, give most of it to charity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T08:30:08-08:00","id":807914,"title":"","content":"I'd take some of it to take care of my family and friends, then use the rest of it to pay for Tamir Rice's legal fees, help fund The People's Bailout, support entrepeneurship in Africa, fight to overturn Citizen's United, etc.","signatu