walmart and the like )<br /> 6. Toys for the baby, as well as assloads of essentials for her.<br /> 7 Buy my daddy a house and car as well as pay off his medical debts and stock his house with food!<br /> 8.Buy the mother in law a house<br /> 9. Donate some to a few random strangers who I see are in need to help get them back on their feet.<br /> 10.the rest sits in the account to pay bills, buy food etc over the next who knows how many years<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T11:59:22-08:00","id":808114,"title":"","content":"I'd probably pay off my student loans. <br /> <br /> As for the rest.. dunno. Maybe some Nachos. (Yes, that joke works for Germany too if you happen to be in just the right income bracket).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T12:00:39-08:00","id":808115,"title":"","content":"The above was in no paticular order lol I just numbered it for some reason.<br /> <br /> edited cause someone posted right after me and i didnt see it...lol my post is the one i'm talking about","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T13:35:21-08:00","id":808189,"title":"","content":"Fund a WoD MMO.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T13:51:59-08:00","id":808208,"title":"","content":"Buy myself a comfortable apartment with at least 3 bedrooms (nothing fancy).<br /> <br /> Fund, invest, and get involved in open-source software, open tabletop RPG projects, and NGOs surrounding openness and the promotion of direct democracy in government and the private sector (especially on issues like huge pay gaps between upper management and the rest of the staff, and male and female employees, corruption etc.).<br /> <br /> Give 1/3 &quot;away&quot; in zero-interest loans to fund small projects and research in Greece. Loans approved based on their societal impact (reversing the brain drain, curbing unemployment, increasing state revenue, promote healthy practices in the private sector and industry).<br /> <br /> Form an NGO that will help immigrants coming to Europe from war-struck zones settle down and receive free, high-quality psychological help (mostly for PTSD).<br /> <br /> If anything's left, I'll fund a couple of need-based scholarships at my college.<br /> <br /> Edit: Or just fund OPP to publish Requiem books on Methuselahs and the High Middle Ages. You know, cause that helps too. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.greece-bynight.com\" target=\"_blank\">Greece By Night LARP</a>","edited":{"userid":59,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/59-stylanski","user":"stylanski","date":". 01-13-2016, 04:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/59-stylanski","name":"stylanski","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar59_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"299"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T14:03:47-08:00","id":808215,"title":"","content":"Give it away in increments for the rest of my life whenever someone I know mentions they really need x amount of money for something. If I die with residual cash, split it between charities and a modest but extremely drunk party at my funeral.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T15:25:59-08:00","id":808278,"title":"","content":"1.) Hire an accountant.<br /> 2.) Hire a tax lawyer. Seriously, the things you can get taxed for with your lottery winnings are <i>nuts</i>.<br /> 3.) Set aside enough that I don't feel like I have to worry about anything. Twenty mill should do it for no longer than I'm apt to live.<br /> 4.) Start spreading it to people I love and/or people I owe, beginning from the assumption the amount I give will have one hundred percent tax on it. The actual number will be less, but that's a useful estimate.<br /> 5.) Find some good charities. I lean toward helping the First Nations, but there are plenty of incurable diseases a person could throw money at, and god knows half a billion dollars can be spread around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T15:41:11-08:00","id":808286,"title":"","content":"1. Invest it so that it doesn't run out.<br /> <br /> 2. set up a red wolf preserve in the Appalachian mountains.<br /> <br /> 3. Gave a cubic truckload to the Temple Grandin foundation, humane society, center for biological diversity (who will be helping me with the red wolf preserve) and fund carbon sequestration research<br /> <br /> 4. Buy that haunted house in the Savannah historic district that the current owner is just using for storage. Live in it and have roommates that don't eat all your food or run up the bills.<br /> <br /> 5. Buy my mom a bigger house in Savannah (because after all the shit I've put her through, she deserves a bigger house than mine, hire a personal IT guy for her so I never have to show her how to use the X-box to watch netflix, update her computer, make her email client work or any other such basic things ever again. Also give her however much money she needs to open her cat cafe in Savannah<br /> <br /> 6. Buy some new exercise equipment<br /> <br /> 7. Use the fact I'm set for life to spend my &quot;working hours&quot; writing my novels. Get movies made based on novels, make even more billions. give even more to more charities.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T18:05:25-08:00","id":808350,"title":"","content":"Wait, wait, I changed my mind. What would it cost to buy White Wolf?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T19:26:33-08:00","id":808383,"title":"","content":"You have to figure out how much a controlling interest in Paradox Interactive would cost. That's how much.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\